font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">변조하여 부정하게 공결을 승인</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">받는 사례가 다수 확인되고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">이는 학사 질서를 어지럽히는 중대한 부정행위로 학교에서는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">이를 엄중히 대응하고자 하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">학생 여러분께서는 아래 내용을 반드시 숙지하여 불이익을 받는 일이 없도록 유의하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">주요 위반 사례</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">진료 날짜 및 시간 수정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">타인의 진료확인서 성명 수정 후 재사용 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">공결 신청 시 증빙서류 제출 관련</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0p