돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">부정 사항 적발 시 조치 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">증빙서류 위</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">변조 확인 시 해당 공결 취소 및 해당 과목 성적 불인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">학생생활지도위원회 회부 및 학칙에 의거한 징계 처분</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;